.codex-consult/
# jobd run captures — the RESULT lives in docs/, the raw log is reproducible
# from the command quoted there and should not be committed as data
_scratch/
# pinned older builds of a module, extracted per-pid so a guard can compare
# against a build that genuinely lacks the thing it guards. Cleaned up on exit;
# ignored so a killed run cannot leave one staged.
sim/.baseline-*.js
sim/.pinned-*.js
sim/.seenfail*.js
